msgid "Popups + editors. Dropdown / SearchableDropdown expose popupOpen plus open() / close() / toggle(); inline TextField uses activeFocus. While any of those own the keys, set PanelKeyCatcher.blocked so the panel's cursor model freezes and the active widget handles input."
